      <lines>
      <chord name="D"/>Praise, my <chord name="A7"/>soul, <chord name="D"/>the <chord name="G"/>King <chord name="F#m"/>of <chord name="G"/>heav<chord name="Em"/><chord name="D"/>en;<br/>
